{
  "_note": "关注的服务(最多 6 个)此刻的状态与进行中事故 —— 看板 / 极简 / 事故三个组件读关注列表,单服务组件传 `ids` 只看一个。数据源:各服务官方 Atlassian Statuspage 公开 JSON(免 key)。\n· Statuspage 原生(sp):status.json(~200B,总体指示灯)+ incidents/unresolved.json(只含未结束事故,平时 ~160B)。⚠️ 不用 summary.json(DigitalOcean 84KB、Zoom 162KB)与 incidents.json(全量,多数 >100KB,越过标准 §3 第 5 条)。\n· incident.io 兼容层(io:OpenAI / Docker / Linear / Notion):status.json 照取,但它的 page.updated_at 长期不动、事故也常不挂服务分项(component) → 指示灯多半一直是 none;unresolved.json 直接 404。进行中事故改从 incidents.json(最新 25 条,30–40KB)的前 3 条里挑未结束的。\n· 每个服务的 URL 是字面量 host:网络白名单静态闭合,用户只能从内置目录里选,不能填任意地址。\n· 组件的 .df 不做缓存(G23 契约 5):刷新意图就是直取。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "idsIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ids},)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删):方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参。`ids` 只有「单服务」组件会传(一个服务 id),其余三个组件不传 → 读用户在首页维护的关注列表。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fl",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "follow",
        "default": [
          "github",
          "claude",
          "openai",
          "vercel"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "关注列表:首页「管理关注」写入的服务 id 数组(最多 6 个,按关注顺序)。没存过时用默认四个 —— 装上就有东西看,首屏不空。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b0",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "读取屏障(勿删):data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到它的结果。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "flj",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${idsIn}),0),${idsIn},join::(${fl},~))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "flk",
        "value": "~${flj}~"
      },
      "_note": "两端补分隔符,下面用 contains::(…,~id~) 判「关注了没有」,不会把 `npm` 误配进别的 id。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "raw",
        "value": "$[split::(${flj},~)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(contains::(${flk},~github~),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "st_github",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/api/v2/status.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ur_github",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/api/v2/incidents/unresolved.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(contains::(${flk},~claude~),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "st_claude",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://status.claude.com/api/v2/status.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
